# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-65958504975f83ff0991198b02c82bb0ba7ec6fb "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-681315eba6f6921d20c8e85246c8563d46f00d67 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
